<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Revelatio Noetica: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body{font:15px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem;max-width:60rem}
h1{font-size:1.5rem}
h2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:2rem 0 .4rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid #8884}
pre{border:1px solid #8884;border-radius:4px;padding:.8rem;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap}
.used-by{font-size:13px;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Revelatio Noetica: third-party licences</h1>

<p>The Revelatio Noetica binary is built from the Rust crates listed below. Each is
used under the licence reproduced with it. Revelatio Noetica itself is under the MIT
License in LICENSE, and the fonts it embeds are listed in NOTICE, with their licence
in OFL.txt.</p>

<p>Licences in this file:
{{#each overview}}{{name}} ({{count}}){{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.</p>

{{#each licenses}}
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<p class="used-by">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}

<hr>
<p><small>Revelatio Noetica &middot; Draconitic Labs &middot; https://github.com/draconitic-labs/revelatio-noetica</small></p>
</body>
</html>
